        <detaileddescription>
<para>Available mesh adaptation strategies:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>adaptation with a Riemannian metric, originating from one or more FE fields. For simplicial meshes only, as anisotropic metric-based meshing libraries exist only for simplicial meshes for now.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>(not yet implemented:) hierarchical adaptation, using deal.II&apos;s routines and p4est. For quad/hex meshes only. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
